This package implements the requested EIT-to-VMC proof-of-concept experiments.
The position-only RBF model, synthetic UI demo generator, and Amodo ARIA serial
reader are adapted from the user's existing ur3e_weight_position_data_collection/
ur3e_code/contact_position.py and eit_reader.py. They are included locally so no
original-workspace path is required at deployment.
The source reference inspected for Franka conventions was the user's
Transformer/VMC_Transformer_Research_Brief/hardware/franka_transformer_cutting
package. Its controller is not a runtime dependency. This package uses direct
libfranka executables inside ROS 2, rather than loading the reference ROS-control
plugin. libfranka and ROS 2 retain their respective licenses.
models/demo_position_model.npz was trained on synthetic UI signals. It is not a
physical-pad model. No physical trained EIT model was present in the supplied
workspace when this package was prepared.
